          "value": "<p>The drake can magically polymorph into a humanoid or back into her true form. It reverts to its true form if it dies. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying is absorbed or borne by the new form (its choice). In a new form, the drake retains its alignment, hit points, ability to speak, proficiencies, Innate Spellcasting and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores, as well as this action.</p>",
